<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina placed $175 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina placed $175 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank announced Thursday it placed $175 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 8.05 percent from 8.15 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99985 pesos from 0.99982 pesos Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
